nary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮았는데","audio":"/audio/cd15446cf36befe67997.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에는","audio":"/audio/89b296d651a66ff651ca.mp3"}},{"text":"병세가","meaning":"病情，病势","explanation":"병세：病情，病势；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"병세","audio":"/audio/6fa3624930d1e6cd696e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58836","senseId":"1","lemma":"병세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병세가","audio":"/audio/be2283091cf2294abecf.mp3"}},{"text":"악화되셨어요.","meaning":"恶化","explanation":"악화되다：恶化；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"악화되다","audio":"/audio/b73843e8c5abd1eca591.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66555","senseId":"2","lemma":"악화되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"악화되셨어요","audio":"/audio/bf075af98f105068164b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a597cb9f723e054b","term":"지난해","zh":"去年","audio":"/audio/a597cb9f723e054ba730.mp3","entryId":"49314","definition":"今年的前一年。","pronunciation":["지난해"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"6fa3624930d1e6cd","term":"병세","zh":"病情，病势","audio":"/audio/6fa3624930d1e6cd696e.mp3","entryId":"58836","definition":"疾病的症状或状态。","pronunciation":["병ː세"]},{"id":"b73843e8c5abd1ec","term":"악화되다","zh":"恶化","audio":"/audio/b73843e8c5abd1eca591.mp3","entryId":"66555","definition":"病势变遭。","pronunciation":["아콰되다","아콰뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/39c6a5fd4a1e4ad49f70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"diffic